+| POST | `/projects/{pid}/members/{uid}/move` | `{"toProjectId"}` → 200 `{"userId","projectId","role"}` |
+
+Moving a member removes them from `{pid}` and adds them to the destination with the same
+role. The caller must be a manager of both projects; the destination must be in the same
+organization, neither project may be archived (409), and the user must not already be a
+member of the destination (409). The user's tasks in the source project become unassigned.
+
 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`.
 
